<h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
<h3>Which EU rules affect battery imports most?</h3>
<p>The EU Battery Regulation (2023/1542) is the main framework: carbon footprint, recycled content, labelling, the battery passport and extended producer responsibility. The exact obligations depend on chemistry and application.</p>
<h3>Is a European gigafactory always cheaper for European buyers?</h3>
<p>Not automatically. Local production avoids some logistics and tariff risk, but cell cost, utilisation and certification still decide the price. Compare landed cost and lead time, not the country of origin alone.</p>
